 "text": "Hi! How's life treating you? Bread, cheese and pickles are the classics. Bread stays crispy in bag for hours, bread and cheese are great on sandwiches, and pickles are always popular. If you buy it on the day and keep it in an inside pocket of the bag, it' fine. Don't overcook it and keep the bag closed until you need it. A cool or a holly bush is better than a cooler. A big tray bake with fruit, nuts and bread is perfect. Serve it with cream cheese and bread.",
